        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>FSB 4251-630 Contemporary Large Flush Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe rectangular sliding door flush pull has a clean, contemporary design. The housing between the satin stainless steel front and back plates is black high impact plastic, allowing the flush pull to be pressure mounted into the door for a clean installation (no screws). It can also be thru-bolted from the back side if used on a thick cabinet door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-FSB-4251-630-size.gif?v=1704442266\" width=\"250\" height=\"420\" border=\"0\" alt=\"FSB 4251-630 Contemporary Flush Door Pull Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors--any door where a \"flush with the door face\" pull is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the FSB 4251-630 Contemporary Large Flush Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 6-7/64\" (155 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-3/4\" (45 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 3/4\" (19 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 21/32\" (17 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 4-1/8\" (105 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-FSB-4251-630.pdf?v=1691093348\" target=\"new\"><b>FSB 4251-630 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/flush-pulls\">Flush Door Pulls</a></b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n</p>",
